There are two distinct points being argued at cross purposes here, and we'r=
e
moving beyond the scope of the beginners list.

Should the official definitions of Lojban words be written in Lojban?
Probably, though as you see, there is some debate.

Are the Lojban definitions of Lojban words currently on jbovlaste official?
Certainly not. They were entered by anyone who wanted to, and hopefully
mostly checked, but who knows? They are not official in any sense. The
current official definitions are the ones in English. And the new BPFK
definitions are also being written in English, though some include Lojban
definitions or equivalences.

